## Demo vs production

| Topic | Demo behavior | Production target |
|-------|---------------|-------------------|
| Auth tokens | e.g. localStorage (demo label) | HttpOnly cookies / BFF (S5) |
| CSP | meta tag (demo) | HTTP header + nonces (S1, S2) |
| E2E | mock adapters on PR | staging smoke L3 optional |
| Accessibility | Partial P1 + roadmap | axe CI on primary flows (P1) |
| Adapters | mock only | production adapter wired |

